   "question": "<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>A sequence of numbers is defined by<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}u_1=6,\\qquad u_2=27\\\\u_{n+2}=6u_{n+1}-9u_n\\qquad n\\geqslant1\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>Prove by induction that, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z^+\"></span></p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_n=3^n(n+1)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></li><li>Prove by induction that, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z^+\"></span><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(n)=3^{3n-2}+2^{3n+1}\\text{ is divisible by }19\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></li></ol>",
